# S636 density supplements removal

date: 2026-11-04
HEAD: 68a15a78

## Diagnosis
/router/workloads and /router/agent-strategy rendered their real readback-driven pages, then view.ts wrapped them with features/density/supplements.ts workloadsSupplement/agentSupplement. Those appended a second "Posture diagnostics" and "Entries", a fake "1 saved · 0 new rows" counter, fixed template buttons and a hardcoded role list. The other supplement users were audited:
- SystemPeers: peersSupplement is a no-op, base is readback-driven.
- LocalLlamaSwapModels: llamaModelsSupplement is a no-op; legacy placeholder helper is unused.
- SessionReadiness: sessionSupplement renders the real systemSessionPage readback.

## Change
- view.ts RouterWorkloads/RouterAgentStrategy now render routerWorkloadsPage/routerAgentStrategyPage directly.
- Removed the two static workloadsSupplement/agentSupplement exports from features/density/supplements.ts; no fabricated counts/entries remain.

## TDD
- RED: s636 with the old wrappers = 2 failed (duplicate Posture diagnostics/Entries) / 1 passed.
- GREEN: s636 3/3; s540 updated to assert the real pages (no chart/tables structure requirement from the removed supplement); tsc 0.

